title: "B-MiRA: Biomedical Mechanism Inference Research Agent"
type: software
version: 2.3.0
date-released: 2026-10-03
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/jung-hankyo/bmira-biomechanism-agent"
abstract: >-
  A LangGraph agent that searches biomedical literature, grades extracted
  claims, and weighs competing mechanism pathways against each other, reporting
  each pathway as Supported, Contradicted or Insufficient evidence.
keywords:
  - biomedical literature
  - mechanism inference
  - LangGraph
  - evidence grading
